{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1019cf70e5a46f47","name":"Gladiatorial Combat Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-1019cf70e5a46f47","title":"Gladiatorial Combat Talent Tree","revision":26911,"timestamp":"2025-08-04T16:29:34Z","sha256":"9bae1b2b2ae8c39d1a83cb76baea941147046ce9ba0eaf7579acac13eba9d95e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26911","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gladiatorial%20Combat%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1019cf70e5a46f47","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned the tricks of fighting in the gladiatorial arena. These Talents represent your knowledge of this specialized combination of combat and showmanship.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Brutal Attack"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," (Chosen Weapon)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose a single weapon with which you posses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," feat. Attacks with such weapons that deal damage (including doubling damage from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},") exceeding an opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," deals +1 die of damage on that attack. You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different weapon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Call Out"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Personal Vendetta"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Personal Vendetta"]}," Talent, you may designate one target of that Talent to take a -5 penalty to attacks against targets other than you, instead of the normal -2 penalty.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Distracting Attack"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Brutal Attack"]}," (Chosen Weapon)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you deal damage to a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", compare the attack roll to the targets' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If the attack roll also meets or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the target takes a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Exotic Weapons Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon Proficiency"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_Proficiency","referenceId":"reference:a5501acefbb91ccb"}," (Any)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You treat all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons"}," as a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},". If you already have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that grant you proficiency with, or augment the use of, one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"},", those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," now apply to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons"},". For example, if you already had ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Shyarn)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_Proficiency_(Shyarn)"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Shyarn)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Shyarn)"},", you are now proficient with, and possess the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," feat for, all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons"},". \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Lockdown Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you hit a moving opponent that is one size category larger than you or smaller with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},", you immediately end its current movement.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Multiattack Proficiency (Exotic Weapons)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Exotic Weapons Master"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you make multiple attacks with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2 points. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2 points.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Personal Vendetta"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can taunt all opponents within 12 squares and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},"; on their next turn, these opponents take a -2 penalty on attack rolls made against any target other than you. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Unstoppable"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks. Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", you can reduce the number of steps you move down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by 1 step (to a minimum of 0).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
